# Copy this file to functions/.dev.vars (gitignored -- never commit it) and
# fill in real values if/when you want genuine Claude responses and a real
# Firebase project. `wrangler dev` (and the functions-dev docker-compose
# service, which runs it) loads functions/.dev.vars automatically.
#
# You do NOT need to fill anything in just to smoke-test the app: leaving
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY blank makes functions/src/lib/anthropicClient.ts fall back
# to a clearly-labeled mock response (prefixed "[MOCK RESPONSE ...]") instead
# of calling the real Anthropic API, so OCR / AI-consultation / AI-report
# flows all still work end-to-end with zero API cost.

# Get a real key from https://console.anthropic.com/ if you want genuine AI
# responses instead of mock ones. Leave blank to use mock responses.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Matches .firebaserc / firebase.json's fake "demo-wanote" project id used by
# the Firebase Local Emulator Suite (docker-compose.yml's firebase-emulators
# service). No real Firebase/GCP project is needed for local dev -- only
# change this if you point the app at a real Firebase project instead.
FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=demo-wanote

# Presence (any non-empty value) tells functions/src/lib/verifyFirebaseToken.ts
# to accept the Firebase Auth Emulator's unsigned ID tokens instead of
# verifying a real signature against Google's JWKS -- without this, every
# authenticated request (AI consultation/report, OCR) would 401 when the
# Flutter app is running against the emulator, since emulator-issued tokens
# are never signed. Leave this UNSET when pointing the backend at a real
# Firebase project (production, or a real project during manual testing).
FIREBASE_AUTH_EMULATOR_HOST=localhost:9099

# RevenueCat secret key, used by functions/src/lib/revenueCatClient.ts to call
# the Promotional Entitlements REST API (campaign-code / referral-code
# redemption -- routes/grantPromotionalEntitlement.ts). Not provisioned yet as
# of writing (no RevenueCat dashboard/secret key exists). Leave blank to use
# a clearly-labeled mock "granted" result instead of calling the real
# RevenueCat API, so the campaign-code redemption flow still works
# end-to-end with zero cost and without a RevenueCat account.
REVENUECAT_SECRET_KEY=
